{"id":"wb-6-665","name":"钟祥文风塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"钟祥文风塔","text":"钟祥文风塔，位于中华人民共和国湖北省荆门市钟祥市郢中镇，是一座砖混实心覆钵式塔。该塔始建于唐朝，当时为一座土塔，后来被毁，明朝时重建。该塔通高20余米，塔基、塔身、塔刹等部分组成，其中塔刹有二十一层相轮。是全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%92%9F%E7%A5%A5%E6%96%87%E9%A3%8E%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85759931,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85759931","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/57d3bf71bcc914adcf25a7dc.jpg","title":"钟祥文峰塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%92%9F%E7%A5%A5%E6%96%87%E5%B3%B0%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/%E9%92%9F%E7%A5%A5%E6%96%87%E5%B3%B0%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​钟祥文峰塔（文风塔）。","width":320,"height":439}}